<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Polo Ralph Lauren started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Polo Ralph Lauren started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Polo Ralph Lauren Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley was an underwriter of Polo Ralph Lauren's initial public offering in June.</p>
<p>-- Polo Ralph Lauren gained 5/16 to 28-3/8.</p>
</text>
